 "remarks": "Located at the iconic corner of Main Street and Washington Boulevard, this second-floor commercial space offers unbeatable visibility and access in the heart of Stamford's business district - Columbus Park. Inside, you'll find a thoughtfully designed layout featuring multiple private offices, a glass-walled conference room, collaboration zones, kitchenette, and storage areas. The space exudes character with exposed brick walls, steel beams, abundant natural light, and hardwood floors throughout - blending industrial charm with professional functionality. Ideal for creative agencies, startups, law firms, or design-forward businesses looking to establish themselves in a walkable, transit-rich location. Just minutes to Metro-North, restaurants, and Stamford's vibrant downtown scene.",
